#~ "模式）、`Random Vacancy`、`Random Doping` 的 group 约束使用。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Write an A/B label for every atom in `atoms.arrays['group']` using k-"
#~ "vector layers or fractional-coordinate parity. Downstream `Magnetic "
#~ "Order` (AFM group mode), `Random Vacancy`, and `Random Doping` can use "
#~ "these labels as region or sublattice constraints."

#~ msgid "**这是一张元数据卡，不改坐标也不改元素，只写 group 标签。**"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**This is a metadata card. It changes neither coordinates nor species; it "
#~ "only writes group labels.**"

#~ msgid "场景：k-vector AFM 无法匹配你的晶格，模型 AFM 能量系统性偏高"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: A k-vector AFM pattern does not match the lattice"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 NiO 上用 `Magnetic Order` 的 k-vector 111 模式生成了 AFM 结构。训练后"
#~ "模型对 AFM 构型的能量预测仍比 DFT 高 0.3 eV/atom——k-vector 的波节面穿过了"
#~ "两种不等价原子位，导致 Ni 和 O 都被混合分配正负号，没有形成\"一层 Ni↑、一"
#~ "层 Ni↓\"的清晰子晶格翻转。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "In NiO, a k-vector 111 AFM assignment crosses inequivalent sites and "
#~ "mixes signs across Ni and O rather than producing the intended "
#~ "alternating Ni layers. The resulting AFM training definition does not "
#~ "match the physical sublattices."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** k-vector 是晶体学均匀的翻转模式，适合简单 Bravais 晶格。但"
#~ "实际磁性材料常有不等价子晶格——你需要手动定义哪些原子属于 A 子晶格（正磁"
#~ "矩）、哪些属于 B（负磁矩）。`Group Label` 就是做这件事的：先在结构里写好 "
#~ "group 标签，下游 `Magnetic Order` 再用 group A/B 模式按标签翻转磁矩。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** A k-vector gives a crystallographically uniform modulation "
#~ "and is natural for a simple Bravais lattice. With inequivalent "
#~ "sublattices, define membership explicitly: label A and B first, then let "
#~ "`Magnetic Order` assign signs by group."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个 NiO 超胞，Ni 和 O 交替排列在 fcc 子晶格上"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** A NiO supercell with alternating Ni and O fcc sublattices."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 按 k-vec 111 分组，奇数层 = A，偶数层 = B"
#~ msgstr "**Objective:** Label alternating k-vector 111 layers as A and B."

#~ msgid "`Overwrite` = 勾选"
#~ msgstr "Enable `Overwrite`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出：** 结构不变，但每个原子现在有 `group` = `A` 或 `B`，带 "
#~ "`Grp(k111,A/B)` 标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Unchanged geometry with per-atom `group` A or B and structure "
#~ "label `Grp(k111,A/B)`."

